{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_0134fVX3ZAVrP57Vp6FsbtYF","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t# Aurora\n2\t\n3\tThree nightly multi-agent sweeps that discover, validate, and catalog the\n4\topen-source Claude/agent ecosystem — Skills & Templates (23:00), Tools (00:00),\n5\tAgents (01:00). Outputs: a SQLite knowledge base, a browsable markdown library,\n6\tnightly executive summaries, an 08:30 morning briefing, and a `helping-hand`\n7\tplugin that surfaces matches from the library in any Cowork or Claude Code session.\n8\t\n9\tPlan and decisions: `C:\\dev\\Skill Foundry\\notes\\skills-and-agent-tips\\NIGHTLY_SWEEP_PLAN.md` (v3).\n10\t\n11\t## Quick start (P1 scaffolding only — no live sweeps yet)\n12\t\n13\t```bash\n14\tcd C:\\dev\\aurora\n15\tpython -m venv .venv\n16\t.venv\\Scripts\\activate\n17\tpip install -e .[dev]\n18\tcp .env.example .env       # then edit .env with real keys\n19\tpython -m aurora.orchestrator --sweep skills --dry-run\n20\t```\n21\t\n22\t`--dry-run` walks the pipeline structurally (loads the seed map, registers a\n23\trun row with `status='dry_run'`, exercises each role's contract) but makes no\n24\tLLM calls and no network fetches. Use this to verify the wiring is correct\n25\tbefore P2 (first real sweep against a single seed).\n26\t\n27\t## Layout\n28\t\n29\t```\n30\taurora/\n31\t  orchestrator.py       entry point; --sweep {skills,tools,agents} [--dry-run]\n32\t  sweeps/               sweep-specific prompts & configs\n33\t  roles/                scout, quarantine, static_screener, runner,\n34\t                        critic_a, critic_b, reconciler, embedder, librarian\n35\t  kb/\n36\t    schema.sql          full v3 schema (§6 of plan)\n37\t    aurora.db           live SQLite database\n38\t    pricing.yaml        vendor pricing for cost estimation\n39\t    apply_schema.py     idempotent schema applier\n40\t  seed_map/\n41\t    skills.yaml         seeds for the 23:00 sweep\n42\t    tools.yaml          seeds for the 00:00 sweep\n43\t    agents.yaml         seeds for the 01:00 sweep\n44\t    quarantine/         shadow-mode seeds (3 nights before promotion)\n45\t  library/              human-browsable curated catalog (by-kind)\n46\t  reports/              nightly exec summaries + morning briefings\n47\t  prompts/              versioned prompt templates (SHA pinned per run)\n48\t  inspect/              cloned upstream repos for inspection (gitignored)\n49\t  sandbox/              ephemeral per-run scratch (gitignored)\n50\t  logs/                 transcripts + artifact bundles (gitignored)\n51\t  lock/                 file-based sweep mutex (gitignored)\n52\t```\n53\t\n54\t## Decisions locked in §17 of the plan\n55\t\n56\t| Item | Value |\n57\t|---|---|\n58\t| Runner sandbox | Docker (Docker Desktop) |\n59\t| Scheduler | Windows Task Scheduler (primary), Cowork mirror |\n60\t| Critic B | Gemini (primary), local OpenAI-compatible (fallback) |\n61\t| Aurora root | `C:\\dev\\aurora\\` |\n62\t| Morning briefing | 08:30 Cowork scheduled session |\n63\t| API keys | Dedicated Aurora keys, $50/mo Anthropic + $10/mo Gemini caps |\n64\t| HH threshold | 0.65 (starting) |\n65\t| GitHub repo | `github.com/<handle>/aurora-library` (private, personal) |\n66\t| PAT | Fine-grained, 90-day rotation, briefing reminders at 7/3/1d |\n67\t| Initial collaborators | John only for v1 |\n68\t\n69\t## Phase status\n70\t\n71\t- ✅ **P0** — Plan v3 (`NIGHTLY_SWEEP_PLAN.md`)\n72\t- 🟡 **P1** — Scaffolding (this directory; orchestrator skeleton)\n73\t- ⬜ **P2** — Skills sweep end-to-end against one seed (no swarm)\n74\t- ⬜ **P3** — Full Skills sweep with swarm\n75\t- ⬜ **P4** — Tools sweep\n76\t- ⬜ **P5** — Agents sweep\n77\t- ⬜ **P6** — Scheduled tasks live\n78\t- ⬜ **P7** — Helping Hand plugin + threshold calibration\n79\t- ⬜ **P8** — GitHub publisher + first collaborator\n80\t- ⬜ **P9** — Learned hyperbolic embedding (gated to ≥500 artifacts)\n81\t\n82\t## Notes\n83\t\n84\tTactical questions surfacing during implementation go in `NOTES.md`.\n85\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01EWp7xYPhNGPdp6bdeA6FWy","session_id":"5f986a64-6630-4578-8cdf-92983029246b","uuid":"9ce400cc-dc86-426e-b0f3-843f8bf27895","timestamp":"2026-06-23T19:12:17.330Z","subagent_type":"Explore","task_description":"Trace Aurora strategic trajectory"}
