{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01MADBssqMv5MihooPU5U6ZF","type":"tool_result","content":"3:Three nightly multi-agent sweeps that discover, validate, and catalog the\n4:open-source Claude/agent ecosystem — Skills & Templates (23:00), Tools (00:00),\n5:Agents (01:00). Outputs: a SQLite knowledge base, a browsable markdown library,\n6:nightly executive summaries, an 08:30 morning briefing, and a `helping-hand`\n7:plugin that surfaces matches from the library in any Cowork or Claude Code session.\n45:  library/              human-browsable curated catalog (by-kind)\n46:  reports/              nightly exec summaries + morning briefings\n62:| Morning briefing | 08:30 Cowork scheduled session |\n65:| GitHub repo | `github.com/<handle>/aurora-library` (private, personal) |\n66:| PAT | Fine-grained, 90-day rotation, briefing reminders at 7/3/1d |"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01EWp7xYPhNGPdp6bdeA6FWy","session_id":"5f986a64-6630-4578-8cdf-92983029246b","uuid":"fdebc22a-6bd1-4b64-b0b0-b9e34c644383","timestamp":"2026-06-23T19:12:30.282Z","subagent_type":"Explore","task_description":"Trace Aurora strategic trajectory"}
