{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_019QMPTA1FddtF5H5ZcRQkpu","type":"tool_result","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Perfect. I now have comprehensive evidence. Let me prepare the final report.\n\n## Aurora Operational Reality Assessment\n\nAurora is **actively running and producing real, substantive outputs daily**. Here's the grounded evidence:\n\n---\n\n### 1. Reports & Latest Summary (Real Data)\n\nThe **latest_summary.json** (generated 2026-06-23 06:47:03) contains:\n\n```json\n{\n  \"date\": \"2026-06-23\",\n  \"productivity_index\": 0.23809523809523808,\n  \"productivity_index_status\": \"ok\",\n  \"costs\": {\n    \"anthropic_mtd\": 22.034652,\n    \"gemini_mtd\": 0.0022862\n  },\n  \"finds\": {\n    \"skills\": 49,\n    \"tools\": 212,\n    \"agents\": 46\n  },\n  \"finds_new\": {\n    \"skills\": 0,\n    \"tools\": 1,\n    \"agents\": 1\n  },\n  \"top_finds\": [\n    { \"name\": \"archive-crawler\", \"kind\": \"agent\", \"why\": \"Usable agent for multi-source archive synthesis; strong adoption (22k★), security-first design...\" },\n    { \"name\": \"benchmark-due-diligence\", \"kind\": \"skill\", \"why\": \"Usable agent skill for competitive analysis & debunking...\" }\n  ],\n  \"session_note\": \"# Aurora briefing — 2026-06-23\\n\\n**New finds today:** 2 (skills 0 · tools 1 · agents 1)...\",\n  \"value_health\": {\n    \"rag\": \"amber\",\n    \"rag_reason\": \"value signals are open-loop — too few logged decisions (n<30) to trust an adoption rate yet.\"\n  }\n}\n```\n\n**Not empty scaffolding.** The summary contains:\n- Real aggregate cost tracking: **$22.03 Anthropic + $0.002 Gemini MTD** (against $50/$10 budgets respectively)\n- Live catalog: **307 total items** (49 skills, 212 tools, 46 agents) with verified quality badges\n- Today's new finds: **2 artifacts** discovered and screened\n- Session notes with substantive evaluations of each top find\n\nMorning briefing reports are generated **daily at 06:47 UTC** (evidenced by latest file timestamps: 2026-06-23 10:143 KB, 2026-06-22 14 KB, 2026-06-21 12 KB).\n\n---\n\n### 2. Library Catalog (Substantive, Not Thin)\n\n**C:\\dev\\aurora\\library\\index.md** (generated 2026-06-23T12:47:03) contains:\n\n- **590 placeable artifacts** mapped across domains (agent-internals > memory-and-learning, planning, etc.)\n- **357 models** cataloged with pricing/licensing metadata\n- **Verified subdirectories:**\n  - agents/: **47 subdirectories** (academic-verify, archive-crawler, apple-notes, bear-notes, gbrain, letta-v1, mem0, hermes-agent, etc.)\n  - skills/: **47 subdirectories** (frontier-taste-best-in-class, pm-warm-start, etc.)\n  - tools/: **212 subdirectories** (agent-memory-elasticsearch, yanchen184/claude-self-sync, NevaMind-AI/memU, hermes-agent.org, etc.)\n  - models/: **64 subdirectories**\n\nEach library entry includes: source repo, quality badges (verified/lossy), adoption signals (GitHub stars), security status, complexity ratings (recipe/workflow/autonomous/open-ended).\n\n**Real content:** 590 rows in structured table; library/index.md is 3 KB, generated fresh each morning.\n\n---\n\n### 3. Knowledge Base (aurora.db)\n\n- **File size: 34.5 MB** (C:\\dev\\aurora\\kb\\aurora.db, last modified 2026-06-23 05:22:12)\n- **Active growth:** Backups show progression from 14.7 MB (pre-A7) → 24.1 MB (pre-B) → 26.0 MB (May 29) → 34.5 MB (June 23)\n- **Nightly sweep writes:** Each night's orchestrator logs show:\n  - agents sweep (2026-06-23 01:07): fetched=53, screened=53, placed=53, usd=$0.1816\n  - skills sweep: fetched=134, screened=134, placed=134, usd=$0.3239\n  - tools sweep: fetched=125, screened=104, placed=104, usd=$0.2539\n  - models sweep: fetched=340, screened 323, placed=323, usd=$0.2333\n\n**Not dormant:** DB is actively written to 5–6x per night.\n\n---\n\n### 4. Scheduled Tasks (5 Daily + 2 Weekly, Evidence of Execution)\n\n**C:\\dev\\aurora\\bin\\setup-tasks.ps1** defines:\n\n**Daily tasks (staggered early morning UTC to